# Exact preference help strings from calibre 9.19.
HOVER_TEXT = {'<p>Click to move the row up 1. Shift+click to move the row up 5. Ctrl+click to move the row up 10. Ctrl+Shift+click to move the row to the top. Keyboard shortcut: Ctrl+Up arrow</p>': '按一下上移一列；Shift+點擊上移五列；Ctrl+點擊上移十列；Ctrl+Shift+點擊移至最上方。快捷鍵為 '
                                                                                                                                                                                         'Ctrl+向上鍵。',
 '<p>Click to move the row down 1. Shift+click to move the row down 5. Ctrl+click to move the row down 10. Ctrl+Shift+click to move the row to the bottom. Keyboard shortcut: Ctrl+Down arrow</p>': '按一下下移一列；Shift+點擊下移五列；Ctrl+點擊下移十列；Ctrl+Shift+點擊移至最下方。快捷鍵為 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                    'Ctrl+向下鍵。',
 '<p>Check this box to make Quickview show books only in the\ncurrent Virtual library. If unchecked, Quickview ignores Virtual libraries. If\nunchecked then only row changes are taken into account.</p>': '勾選後，快速檢視只顯示目前虛擬書庫中的書。取消勾選時會忽略虛擬書庫，且只根據書本列的變動更新。',
 '<p>Check this box to make Quickview change the column being examined\nwhen the column in the book list is changed using the cursor arrow keys</p>': '勾選後，使用方向鍵切換書本清單的欄位時，快速檢視也會變更正在檢查的欄位。',
 '<p>Pressing Enter in a cell changes both the book and the\ncolumn being examined (the left-hand panel)</p>': '在儲存格按 '
                                                                                                               'Enter '
                                                                                                               '鍵，會同時變更左側面板檢查的書本與欄位。',
 '<p>Double-clicking in a cell changes both the book and the\ncolumn being examined (the left-hand panel)</p>': '在儲存格按兩下，會同時變更左側面板檢查的書本與欄位。',
 '<p>Click to move the row up 1. Shift+click to move the row up 5.\nCtrl+click to move the row up 10. Ctrl+Shift+click to move the row to the top.\nKeyboard shortcut: Ctrl+Up arrow</p>': '按一下上移一列；Shift+點擊上移五列；Ctrl+點擊上移十列；Ctrl+Shift+點擊移至最上方。快捷鍵為 '
                                                                                                                                                                                           'Ctrl+向上鍵。',
 '<p>Click to move the row down 1. Shift+click to move the row down 5.\nCtrl+click to move the row down 10. Ctrl+Shift+click to move the row to the bottom.\nKeyboard shortcut: Ctrl+Down arrow</p>': '按一下下移一列；Shift+點擊下移五列；Ctrl+點擊下移十列；Ctrl+Shift+點擊移至最下方。快捷鍵為 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                      'Ctrl+向下鍵。',
 '<p>The template used to generate the text below the covers. This template uses\nthe same syntax as save templates. Defaults to just the book title.\nNote that this setting is per-library, which means that you have to\nset it again for every different calibre library you use. Use an\nempty template for no text.</p>': '此範本用於產生封面下方的文字，語法與儲存範本相同，預設顯示書名。每個書庫各自儲存此設定。留空即可隱藏文字。',
 '<p>Normally, the book title and subtitle are displayed in a font size that is scaled with the height of the cover browser window. If you want to limit the maximum size of this text, use this setting.': '書名與副標題通常會依封面瀏覽器的高度縮放字型。此設定可限制文字的最大字型大小。',
 'This check box cannot be changed after any other changes have been made.\nOtherwise all edits would be lost.': '變更其他設定後就無法切換此核取方塊，否則會遺失所有編輯內容。',
 'Delete the selected rule. The Category cell for the rule must be selected': '刪除選取的規則。必須先選取該規則的「分類」儲存格。',
 'Edit the selected cell': '編輯選取的儲存格。',
 'Undo changes in the selected cell, if any.': '復原選取儲存格中尚未保留的變更。',
 "Add a new rule. The rule is added immediately. If you decide you don't\nwant it then you must delete it.": '新增規則並立即套用。若不需要，請刪除該規則。',
 "<p>Check the box for an item if it is to be displayed as a\nhierarchical tree in the Tag browser. For example, if you check\n'tags' then tags of the form 'Mystery.English'\nand 'Mystery.Thriller' will be displayed with English and Thriller\nboth under 'Mystery'. If 'tags' is not checked\nthen the tags will be displayed each on their own line.</p>\n<p>The categories 'authors', 'publisher', 'news', 'formats', and 'rating'\ncannot be hierarchical.</p>\n<p>User categories are always hierarchical and so do not appear in this list.</p>": '勾選項目後，標籤瀏覽器會以階層樹狀方式顯示。例如標籤 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            'Mystery.English '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            '與 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            'Mystery.Thriller '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            '會將 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            'English '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            '和 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            'Thriller '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            '放在 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            'Mystery '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            '底下。取消勾選時，各標籤分行顯示。authors、publisher、news、formats '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            '和 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            'rating '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            '不支援階層。使用者分類一律採階層顯示，因此不列在此處。',
 'Click this button to reset the list to its default order.': '將清單還原為預設順序。',
 '<p>Click this button to set the list to one\npreviously exported. This could be useful if you have several libraries with\nsimilar structure and you want to use the same for each one.</p>': '載入先前匯出的清單。多個書庫結構相近時，可共用相同設定。',
 '<p>Click this button to write the current display\nsettings to a file. This could be useful if you have several libraries with similar\nstructure and you want to use the same for each one.</p>': '將目前的顯示設定匯出到檔案，供結構相近的其他書庫使用。',
 "<p>Set the order of the searches when clicking on an item in\nthe Tag browser. The 'or its children' options are ignored when clicking on\ntop-level categories, items that aren't in a hierarchical category, and items\nthat don't have children.</p>": '設定點選標籤瀏覽器項目時的搜尋順序。點選頂層分類、非階層分類的項目或沒有子項目的項目時，會忽略「或其子項目」選項。',
 'Move up. Keyboard shortcut: Ctrl+Up arrow': '上移。快捷鍵為 Ctrl+向上鍵。',
 'Move down. Keyboard shortcut: Ctrl+Down arrow': '下移。快捷鍵為 Ctrl+向下鍵。',
 '<p>Choose how Tag browser subcategories are displayed when\nthere are more items than the limit. Select by first\nletter to see an A, B, C list. Choose partitioned to\nhave a list of fixed-sized groups. Set to disabled\nif you never want subcategories</p>': '設定標籤瀏覽器項目超過上限時的子分類顯示方式。可依首字母顯示 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    'A、B、C '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    '清單，或分割為固定數量的群組。不需要子分類時請選擇停用。',
 '<p>If collapsing by first letter, combine adjacent letters together if\nthere are fewer items under a letter than specified here. If the partition method is\nnot set to first letter, this value is ignored. Set to zero to disable.</p>': '依首字母折疊時，若某字母底下的項目少於此數值，就合併相鄰字母。其他分割方式會忽略此值，設為零可停用。',
 '<p>If a Tag browser category has more than this number of items, it is divided\nup into subcategories. If the partition method is set to disable, this value is ignored.</p>': '標籤瀏覽器分類的項目超過此數量時，會分割為子分類。停用分類分割時會忽略此值。',
 "<p>Check the box for categories that are to\nbe partitioned using the criteria above. Uncheck the box if you don't want to\npartition a category even if the number of items is larger than\nthe value shown above. This option can be used to\navoid collapsing hierarchical categories that have only\na few top-level elements.</p>": '勾選要依上述條件分割的分類。取消勾選後，即使項目超過上限也不分割。可用來避免只有少量頂層項目的階層分類被折疊。',
 'User categories and Saved searches cannot be moved': '使用者分類與已儲存的搜尋無法移動。',
 '<p>Click to move the row up 1. Shift+click to move the row up 5.\nCtrl+click to move the row up 10. Ctrl+Shift+click to move the row to the top.\nUser categories and Saved searches cannot be moved.\nKeyboard shortcut: Ctrl+Up arrow</p>': '按一下上移一列；Shift+點擊上移五列；Ctrl+點擊上移十列；Ctrl+Shift+點擊移至最上方。使用者分類與已儲存的搜尋無法移動。快捷鍵為 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                'Ctrl+向上鍵。',
 '<p>Click to move the row down 1. Shift+click to move the row down 5.\nCtrl+click to move the row down 10. Ctrl+Shift+click to move the row to the bottom.\nUser categories and Saved searches cannot be moved.\nKeyboard shortcut: Ctrl+Down arrow</p>': '按一下下移一列；Shift+點擊下移五列；Ctrl+點擊下移十列；Ctrl+Shift+點擊移至最下方。使用者分類與已儲存的搜尋無法移動。快捷鍵為 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           'Ctrl+向下鍵。',
 "<p>Click this button to set the list to one\npreviously exported. This could be useful if you have several libraries with\nsimilar structure and you want to use the same column order for each one. Columns\nin the imported list that aren't in the current library are ignored. Columns in\nthe library that are not in the imported list are put at the end and marked\nas displayable.</p>": '載入先前匯出的清單，讓結構相近的書庫共用欄位順序。匯入清單中不存在於目前書庫的欄位會被忽略；目前書庫中未列在匯入清單的欄位會移到末尾並設為可顯示。',
 '<p>Click this button to write the current display\nsettings to a file. This could be useful if you have several libraries with similar\nstructure and you want to use the same column order for each one.</p>': '將目前的顯示設定匯出到檔案，讓結構相近的書庫共用欄位順序。',
 'Show an icon if the item has an attached link': '項目附有連結時顯示圖示。',
 '<p>Show counts for items in the Tag browser. Such as the number of books\nby each author, the number of authors, etc. If you turn it off, you can still\nsee the counts by hovering your mouse over any item.</p>': '顯示標籤瀏覽器的項目數量，例如每位作者的書本數與作者總數。停用後仍可將游標移到項目上查看數量。',
 'Show an icon if the item has an attached note': '項目附有筆記時顯示圖示。',
 '<p>When checked, calibre will automatically hide any category\n(a column, custom or standard) that has no items to show. For example, some\ncategories might not have values when using Virtual libraries. Checking this\nbox will cause these empty categories to be hidden.</p>': '自動隱藏沒有項目的分類，包括標準與自訂欄位。例如使用虛擬書庫時，沒有數值的分類會被隱藏。',
 'If checked the notes and links icons will be placed at the right, after\nthe count and in columns. If unchecked, the icons will be placed immediately after the text,\nto the left of the count and not in columns.': '勾選後，筆記與連結圖示會在數量右側以欄位排列。取消勾選時，圖示會緊接文字，放在數量左側。',
 '<p>When checked, Find in the Tag browser will show all items\nthat match the search instead of the first one. If Hide empty categories is\nalso checked then only categories containing a matched item will be shown.</p>': '標籤瀏覽器搜尋會顯示所有符合項目。若同時啟用「隱藏空白分類」，則只顯示包含符合項目的分類。',
 '<p>Ensure the last "used" item in the Tag browser is visible when opening a library.\nAn item is "used" when it is expanded, collapsed, or clicked.</p>': '開啟書庫時，確保標籤瀏覽器上次展開、折疊或點選的項目可見。',
 '<p>When checked, items in hierarchical categories that have\nno books of their own and only contain sub-items are shown before the other\nitems, like folders in a file manager, whatever the sort order.</p>': '階層分類中，只有子項目且本身沒有書本的項目會優先顯示，類似檔案管理員中的資料夾，不受排序順序影響。',
 "<p>When checked, the Tag browser can get keyboard focus, allowing\nuse of the keyboard to navigate the tree using the arrow keys. The Enter key simulates\na click on the selected item. The keyboard shortcut 'Tag browser /\nGive the Tag browser keyboard focus' changes the keyboard focus without\nusing the mouse.</p>": '允許標籤瀏覽器取得鍵盤焦點，以方向鍵瀏覽樹狀清單。Enter '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 '鍵等同點選項目。可使用「標籤瀏覽器／讓標籤瀏覽器取得鍵盤焦點」快捷鍵切換焦點。',
 "<p>The spacing between consecutive items in the Tag browser.\nIn units of (ex) which is the approximate height of the letter 'x' in the\ncurrently used font.</p>": '標籤瀏覽器相鄰項目的間距。單位 '
                                                                                                                                                                      'ex '
                                                                                                                                                                      '約等於目前字型小寫 '
                                                                                                                                                                      'x '
                                                                                                                                                                      '的高度。',
 '<p>Check this box to make the edit metadata dialogs ignore the\nabove specifications, showing all the columns in the default order. This is\nuseful for temporarily seeing all your columns in the dialogs without losing\nthe display and order specifications.</p>': '暫時忽略上述顯示與順序設定，依預設順序顯示所有欄位，方便查看全部欄位並保留原本配置。',
 'If checked then labels wider than the label width\nwill be elided, otherwise they will be word wrapped.': '勾選後，超過寬度的標籤會以省略號縮短；取消勾選則自動換行。',
 'Choose where in the label to put the...': '選擇標籤中省略號出現的位置。',
 '<p>Check this box to allow only the F2 (Edit) key to\nopen the template editor in the book list for a "Column built from other\ncolumns". Editing with mouse clicks and the Tab key will be disabled.</p>': '僅允許按 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                              'F2（編輯）鍵開啟書本清單中「從其他欄位建立的欄位」範本編輯器。停用滑鼠點擊與 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                              'Tab '
                                                                                                                                                                                                              '鍵編輯。',
 'The maximum width of a custom column label for the bulk metadata edit dialog in average characters.': '批次編輯中繼資料視窗的自訂欄位標籤最大寬度，以平均字元寬度計算。',
 'The maximum width of a custom column label for the single metadata edit dialog in average characters.': '單本編輯中繼資料視窗的自訂欄位標籤最大寬度，以平均字元寬度計算。',
 'Enter the URL to search. It should contain the string {author}\nwhich will be replaced by the author name. For example,\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search={author}. Note: the author name is already URL-encoded.': '輸入搜尋網址，必須包含會被作者名稱取代的 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 '{author}。例如 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 'https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search={author}。作者名稱已完成網址編碼。',
 'Click this button to open the template tester': '開啟範本測試器。',
 "<p>Check the box if you want the category's values displayed on separate lines instead of separated by commas</p>": '將分類數值分行顯示，取代以逗號分隔的方式。',
 'Increase or decrease the size of the links and notes icons by this number. Larger\nthan one increases the icon size while smaller than one decreases it.': '調整連結與筆記圖示大小的倍率。大於一會放大，小於一會縮小。',
 'Control the color theme to use for the bookshelf view': '設定書架檢視的色彩主題。',
 'Use a custom background, either color or image': '使用自訂背景顏色或圖片。',
 'Control the height of the book shelves, in pixels. The default is to choose a height automatically based on the size of the screen. Note that if you change the height, the cover thumbnail cache will need to be re-populated so scrolling might be a little slow to start with.': '設定書架高度，單位為像素。預設依螢幕大小自動選擇。變更高度後需重新建立封面縮圖快取，初次捲動可能較慢。',
 'Control how the height of book spines varies on the shelf. "Constant" makes all books the same height. "Constant per group" makes all books in the same group the same height. "Variable" gives each book a unique height.': '設定書架上的書脊高度。「固定」讓所有書本同高；「群組內固定」讓同組書本同高；「可變」讓每本書有不同高度。',
 'Control what happens when the mouse hovers over the spine of a book.': '設定游標停留在書脊上時的動作。',
 'Control the style to use for the group divider': '設定群組分隔標題的樣式。',
 'Control whether the text of the group divider is aligned to the right or left': '設定群組分隔標題的文字靠右或靠左對齊。',
 'When grouping books and a group extends to more than one shelf, place a group divider at the beginning of the additional shelves': '書本群組跨越多個書架時，在後續書架的開頭放置群組分隔標題。',
 'Have calibre re-count the pages in all books in the current library.': '重新計算目前書庫中所有書本的頁數。',
 '<p>How much to blend the cover into the spine. Higher values decrease blending.': '設定封面融入書脊的程度。數值越高，混合程度越低。',
 '<p>The template used to generate the main text on the spine. This template uses the same syntax as save templates. Defaults to just the book title. Note that this setting is per-library, which means that you have to set it again for every different calibre library you use.\n<p>For example, if you want the first line to be the book title in upper case, you can use the template: <code>{title:uppercase()}</code>': '產生書脊主要文字的範本，語法與儲存範本相同，預設顯示書名。每個書庫各自設定。例如 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 '{title:uppercase()} '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 '可將第一行書名轉為大寫。',
 '<p>The template used to generate an optional second line of text on the spine. This template uses the same syntax as save templates. Defaults to no second line. For example, use the value {authors} to show the book authors. Note that this setting is per-library, which means that you have to set it again for every different calibre library you use.</p>': '產生書脊第二行文字的範本，語法與儲存範本相同，預設不顯示第二行。例如 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      '{authors} '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      '可顯示作者。每個書庫各自設定。',
 'The minimum font size for text on the spine. It is a fraction of the base font size.': '書脊文字的最小字型大小，以基準字型大小的比例表示。',
 'The maximum font size for text on the spine. It is a multiple of the base font size.': '書脊文字的最大字型大小，以基準字型大小的倍數表示。',
 '<p>Set the thickness, in pixels, of the outline (border) around text on the spine. A value of zero means no outline. An outline helps the text standout against the spine, especially when the spine has a colorful cover.': '書脊文字外框的厚度，單位為像素。零代表不使用外框。外框可讓文字在彩色封面背景上更清楚。',
 'Control whether the text shown on book spines goes upwards or downwards': '設定書脊文字向上或向下排列。',
 '<p>When showing a second line in the spine, for very narrow books, artificially widen the book to make space for the second line. Without this, the second line will not be displayed for narrow books, with it, narrow books will appear artificially wider than they really are.': '顯示第二行文字時，加寬較窄的書脊以保留空間。停用時窄書脊不顯示第二行；啟用後，書脊顯示寬度可能大於實際寬度。',
 '<p>By default, the text is drawn at the bottom of the cell, leaving a gap between text and cover when the cover is small or has a wide aspect ratio. This option instead causes the text to be drawn flush with the bottom of the cover.': '預設文字位於儲存格底部，封面較小或較寬時，文字與封面之間會留空。此選項讓文字緊貼封面底部。',
 'Round the corners of covers in many places they are displayed such as the Cover grid, Book details panel, etc. Adjust the amount of rounding with this setting. A value of between 5 and 10 looks good with most covers sizes. Zero disables rounding and is the default.': '調整封面窗格、書本詳細資料等位置的封面圓角。多數封面可使用 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              '5 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              '到 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              '10；零代表停用，也是預設值。',
 'The unit for the cover corner rounding. Either pixel values or as a percentage of the cover size.': '封面圓角的單位，可用像素或封面大小的百分比。',
 'Show individual buttons to control the layout of the interface rather than a single button with a popup.': '以多個獨立按鈕控制介面配置，取代單一按鈕的彈出選單。',
 'Disable popup notifications when calibre completes jobs such a conversion, sending to device etc. The notifications are sent via the operating system notification facility, if available.': '停用轉檔、傳送到裝置等工作完成時的彈出通知。系統支援時，通知會透過作業系統的通知功能傳送。',
 'Restore the layout of the main window to the default, showing the Tag browser, book list, Book details and search bar with their default sizes': '將主視窗配置還原為預設值，顯示標籤瀏覽器、書本清單、書本詳細資料與搜尋列，並還原其大小。',
 '<p>Auto-merge: If books with similar titles and authors are found, merge the incoming formats automatically into existing book records. The box to the right controls what happens when an existing record already has the incoming format. Note that this option also affects the Copy to library action.</p>\n<p>Title match ignores leading indefinite articles ("the", "a", "an"), punctuation, case, etc. Author match is exact.</p>': '自動合併：找到書名相近且作者相同的書本時，將新格式加入現有書本記錄。右側選項決定相同格式已存在時的處理方式。此設定也影響「複製到書庫」。書名比對忽略開頭的 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              'the、a、an、標點與大小寫等差異；作者必須完全相同。',
 'Auto-merge: If books with similar titles and authors are found, merge the incoming formats (files) automatically into\nexisting book records. This box controls what happens when an existing record already has\nthe incoming format:\n\nIgnore duplicate incoming formats - means that existing formats in your calibre library will not be replaced\nOverwrite existing duplicate formats - means that existing formats in your calibre library will be replaced\nCreate new record for each duplicate formats - means that a new book entry will be created for each duplicate formats\n\nTitle matching ignores leading indefinite articles ("the", "a", "an"), punctuation, case, etc.\nAuthor matching is exact.': '自動合併：找到書名相近且作者相同的書本時，將新格式加入現有記錄。忽略重複格式會保留既有檔案；覆寫重複格式會取代既有檔案；為重複格式建立新記錄會新增書本記錄。書名比對忽略開頭的 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            'the、a、an、標點與大小寫等差異；作者必須完全相同。',
 'Apply the above tags when a new book record is created in the destination library by the "Copy to library" action': '使用「複製到書庫」在目的書庫建立新書本記錄時，套用上方設定的標籤。',
 '<p>You can specify rules to add/ignore files here. These will be used when recursively adding books from folders.': '設定遞迴加入資料夾中的書本時，要加入或忽略哪些檔案的規則。',
 'When multiple formats are present in a book being converted, this list determines which format will be used as the "source" for the conversion.': '書本具有多種格式時，此清單決定轉檔使用的來源格式順序。',
 '<p>Setting this means that when sorting on text fields\nlike title the text "Book 2" will sort before the text "Book 100".\nNote that setting this can cause problems with text that starts\nwith numbers and is a little slower. This setting is per user, not\nper library.</p>': '依文字欄位排序時辨識數字，例如 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      'Book '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      '2 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      '排在 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      'Book '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      '100 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      '前面。以數字開頭的文字可能有排序問題，且處理速度稍慢。此設定依使用者儲存，由各書庫共用。',
 'File types that are unchecked in this list will be opened with the default program configured in the operating system, for that file type.': '清單中未勾選的檔案類型會使用作業系統為該類型設定的預設程式開啟。',
 "<p>Hierarchical items are separated by periods.\n                  Changing this box will also change the 'Saved Searches' box\n                  in Preferences / Look & feel / Tag browser /\n                  Hierarchy and searching</p>": '階層項目以句點分隔。變更此選項也會更新「偏好設定／介面外觀／標籤瀏覽器／階層與搜尋」中的「已儲存的搜尋」設定。',
 '<p>When enabled, pressing a key in the library view will search for the next cell in the current column where the value starts with the letter pressed. If there is no such cell then nothing happens. If the letter is a shortcut then the shortcut takes precedence.</p>': '在書庫清單按字母鍵時，尋找目前欄位中以該字母開頭的下一個儲存格。找不到時不執行動作。若該字母已設定快捷鍵，會優先執行快捷鍵。',
 '<p>When enabled, the current search is kept and re-applied when switching Virtual libraries, instead of being cleared.</p>': '切換虛擬書庫時保留並重新套用目前搜尋。'}

HOVER_TEXT.update({
    "<p>If checked the 'Function' box will show only user defined\ntemplate functions. If unchecked the box will show both system and user defined\nfunctions. Unchecking can be useful for copying source of a system function to create\na new related user defined function.</p>": '勾選時，「函數」欄只顯示使用者定義的範本函式；取消勾選則同時顯示系統與使用者函式。若想複製系統函式的原始碼來建立相關的自訂函式，可先取消勾選。',
    'Open an editor for function documentation': '開啟函式說明文件編輯器',
    'Clear the name, template, and documentation boxes': '清除名稱、範本與說明文件欄位',
    '<p>Delete the current stored template. The name is cleared. The template\nand documentation are not cleared to make it easier to store the template under a new name</p>': '刪除目前的儲存範本並清除名稱。範本與說明文件會保留，方便以新名稱儲存。',
    'Replace the template and documentation for the template with the given name.': '以目前內容取代指定名稱之範本與說明文件。',
    '<p>Create a new stored template with the given name. You must enter the template\ntext before pushing this button.</p>': '以指定名稱建立新的儲存範本。按下按鈕前，必須先輸入範本內容。',
    '<p>Import a stored template from a file created by the Export\nfunction. The import includes the name, the template, and the documentation.</p><p>\nIf a stored template with the imported name already exists then you are asked if you want to replace its\nprogram and documentation with what is in the file.</p><p>\nAfter the import, press the Create or Replace button as appropriate to save the changes.</p>': '<p>從「匯出」功能建立的檔案匯入儲存範本，包含名稱、範本與說明文件。</p><p>若已有同名範本，會詢問是否以檔案內容取代原本的程式與說明文件。</p><p>匯入後，請依情況按「建立」或「取代」儲存變更。</p>',
    '<p>Export the current stored template to a file. The file contains\nthe name, the template, and the documentation.</p>': '將目前的儲存範本匯出到檔案，包含名稱、範本與說明文件。',
    'Open a template tester dialog to use a template to test stored templates': '開啟範本測試視窗，使用範本來測試儲存範本',
})
